{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"越清楚自己要说什么，越明白说出口可能改变关系，于是格外谨慎\",\"source\":\"正因为太清楚，又明白有些话一旦说出口，关系就会改变，所以格外谨慎\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿认为有些话一旦说出口就会改变关系，屏幕稿改成了可能改变，降低了他对这一结果的确定程度。\"},{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"screen\":\"但越用力，水面的颠簸仿佛越剧烈，船舱内的平衡也越脆弱\",\"source\":\"但你越用力，水面的颠簸就越剧烈，船舱内的平衡就越脆弱\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿直接陈述用力与颠簸加剧之间的关系，屏幕稿加入“仿佛”，将确定的描述弱化成了似乎如此。\"},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"screen\":\"在这里被放到了更大的尺度\",\"source\":\"在这里被放到了最大尺度\",\"type\":8,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"“最大尺度”是最高程度，“更大的尺度”只表示程度有所增大，丢失了原来的最高程度含义。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3f36de08-d062-45b8-bd4a-b40a969acf83", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T082856410147Z", "elapsed_seconds": 194.484, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T08:32:10.915243+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "44276fc09d807baeb72c977a495d2691fdb16e7d770001e9c2e0c2d23e014eab", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590